{"seq":2,"slug":"fanout-delivery-engine","title":"扇出投递引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/fanout-delivery-engine","wordCount":1504,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"扇出投递引擎\">扇出投递引擎</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>扇出投递引擎将单个事件复制为 N 次独立的 HTTP POST 投递，同时保证故障隔离、防止慢端点拖慢整体、防止大租户饿死小租户。本文覆盖三种扇出拓扑、队列优先架构、多租户 noisy neighbor 隔离、FIFO 有序投递、Worker 实现要点、以及 Transactional Outbox 模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心挑战-一事件多订阅者\">核心挑战：一事件多订阅者</h2><p>当一个事件（如 <code>order.completed</code>）触发时，可能有数十到数千个活跃订阅者需要接收通知。扇出投递引擎（Fan-out Delivery Engine）的职责是将单个事件高效、可靠地复制为 N 次独立的 HTTP POST 投递，同时保证：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个订阅者的故障不影响其他订阅者</li>\n<li>慢端点不拖慢整体投递延迟</li>\n<li>大租户的高流量不饿死小租户</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"扇出架构模式对比\">扇出架构模式对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 直接扇出&#10;        E1[事件] --&gt; W1[Worker]&#10;        W1 --&gt; S1[订阅者 1]&#10;        W1 --&gt; S2[订阅者 2]&#10;        W1 --&gt; S3[订阅者 N]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 队列扇出&#10;        E2[事件] --&gt; Q[扇出队列]&#10;        Q --&gt; W2[Worker 1] --&gt; S4[订阅者 1]&#10;        Q --&gt; W3[Worker 2] --&gt; S5[订阅者 2]&#10;        Q --&gt; W4[Worker N] --&gt; S6[订阅者 N]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Broker 扇出&#10;        E3[事件] --&gt; B[消息 Broker]&#10;        B --&gt; Q1[队列 1] --&gt; WA[Worker] --&gt; S7[订阅者 1]&#10;        B --&gt; Q2[队列 2] --&gt; WB[Worker] --&gt; S8[订阅者 2]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 直接扇出\n        E1[事件] --&gt; W1[Worker]\n        W1 --&gt; S1[订阅者 1]\n        W1 --&gt; S2[订阅者 2]\n        W1 --&gt; S3[订阅者 N]\n    end\n    subgraph 队列扇出\n        E2[事件] --&gt; Q[扇出队列]\n        Q --&gt; W2[Worker 1] --&gt; S4[订阅者 1]\n        Q --&gt; W3[Worker 2] --&gt; S5[订阅者 2]\n        Q --&gt; W4[Worker N] --&gt; S6[订阅者 N]\n    end\n    subgraph Broker 扇出\n        E3[事件] --&gt; B[消息 Broker]\n        B --&gt; Q1[队列 1] --&gt; WA[Worker] --&gt; S7[订阅者 1]\n        B --&gt; Q2[队列 2] --&gt; WB[Worker] --&gt; S8[订阅者 2]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>隔离级别</th>\n<th>扩展性</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接扇出</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>&lt; 10 订阅者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列扇出</td>\n<td>Worker 级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>10-1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Broker 扇出</td>\n<td>订阅者级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>1000+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（per-tenant queue）</td>\n<td>租户级</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>多租户 SaaS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"队列优先架构详解\">队列优先架构详解</h2><p>生产系统的标准模式是「队列优先」（Queue-First）。事件产生后立即写入持久队列，与投递过程完全解耦：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"应用事务提交&#10;  → INSERT INTO webhook_events (原子性)&#10;  → PUBLISH to event_queue (异步)&#10;  → 投递 Worker CONSUME from queue&#10;  → HTTP POST to subscriber URL&#10;  → ACK (仅当 2xx 或路由到 DLQ)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>应用事务提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → INSERT INTO webhook_events (原子性)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → PUBLISH to event_queue (异步)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 投递 Worker CONSUME from queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → HTTP POST to subscriber URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → ACK (仅当 2xx 或路由到 DLQ)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计决策：</p>\n<p><strong>事件写入与队列发布的原子性</strong>——使用 transactional outbox 模式：先在数据库事务中写入 events 表，后台进程轮询 outbox 发布到队列。这避免了「事务提交但队列发布失败」导致的事件丢失。</p>\n<p><strong>每次投递一条消息</strong>——扇出时为每个订阅者创建独立的投递消息。这确保了单个投递的 ACK/NACK 不影响其他投递。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多租户隔离-noisy-neighbor-问题\">多租户隔离：Noisy Neighbor 问题</h2><p>多租户 webhook 平台面临的最大威胁是 noisy neighbor——一个大租户的高流量或其订阅者的频繁超时，消耗所有 worker 资源，导致其他租户的投递延迟飙升。</p>\n<p>解决方案分层递进：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-公平队列调度-fair-queuing\">1. 公平队列调度（Fair Queuing）</h3><p>为每个租户分配独立的逻辑队列，worker 按 round-robin 从各队列消费：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    T1[租户 A 队列: 1000 msg] --&gt; RR[Round-Robin Scheduler]&#10;    T2[租户 B 队列: 5 msg] --&gt; RR&#10;    T3[租户 C 队列: 50 msg] --&gt; RR&#10;    RR --&gt; WP[Worker Pool]\">graph LR\n    T1[租户 A 队列: 1000 msg] --&gt; RR[Round-Robin Scheduler]\n    T2[租户 B 队列: 5 msg] --&gt; RR\n    T3[租户 C 队列: 50 msg] --&gt; RR\n    RR --&gt; WP[Worker Pool]</pre><p>即使租户 A 队列积压 1000 条消息，每轮调度也只取出与其他租户相同的批量——防止其独占 worker。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-端点级并发控制\">2. 端点级并发控制</h3><p>对同一个消费者端点限制并发投递数（典型值 5-10）。这保护消费者不被突发流量压垮，也防止 worker 被单个慢端点的超时连接耗尽。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-动态-worker-分配\">3. 动态 Worker 分配</h3><p>基于队列深度和延迟 SLO 动态扩缩 worker 数量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>depth</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>SLO</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>throughput</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{target}} = \\max\\left(W_{\\min},\\ \\left\\lceil \\frac{Q_{\\text{depth}}}{T_{\\text{SLO}} \\cdot R_{\\text{throughput}}} \\right\\rceil\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">throughput</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">depth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>depth</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{depth}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">depth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为当前队列深度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>SLO</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{SLO}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为延迟 SLO（如 30 秒内投递），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>throughput</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{throughput}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">throughput</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单 worker 吞吐量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fifo-有序投递\">FIFO 有序投递</h2><p>某些业务场景要求事件按产生顺序投递（如 <code>order.created</code> 必须先于 <code>order.completed</code>）。实现有序投递需要按 partition key 路由到同一 worker：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局有序</td>\n<td>单 worker 串行</td>\n<td>吞吐量极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按资源有序</td>\n<td>hash(resource_id) → partition</td>\n<td>单分区串行，跨分区并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按端点有序</td>\n<td>hash(endpoint_id) → partition</td>\n<td>保证每端点收到的事件有序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尽力有序</td>\n<td>先发先到，不保证</td>\n<td>最高吞吐量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Svix 在 2026 年支持 FIFO ordering 作为端点级配置——消费者可选择牺牲部分吞吐量换取严格有序。大多数系统默认不保证顺序，消费者应通过事件时间戳自行重排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投递-worker-的实现要点\">投递 Worker 的实现要点</h2><p>投递 worker 是引擎的执行单元，其设计直接影响系统的可靠性和效率：</p>\n<p><strong>连接池管理</strong>——对高频端点复用 HTTP 连接（HTTP/2 多路复用或 HTTP/1.1 keep-alive），减少 TLS 握手开销。Svix（Rust 实现）使用 hyper 连接池，单 worker 可维持数千并发连接。</p>\n<p><strong>超时分级</strong>——连接超时 5s、响应超时 30s。超时后立即释放连接资源，将投递标记为失败并按 <a href=\"../fundamentals/delivery-guarantee-retry\">投递保证与重试策略</a> 进入重试队列。</p>\n<p><strong>优雅关闭</strong>——worker 收到停止信号后，完成当前正在进行的投递（不中断 HTTP 请求），但不再从队列取新任务。这避免了重启导致的投递状态不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"transactional-outbox-模式\">Transactional Outbox 模式</h2><p>确保「业务事务」和「事件发布」的原子性是扇出引擎最关键的基础设施问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;  -- 业务操作&#10;  UPDATE orders SET status = &#39;completed&#39; WHERE id = $1;&#10;  -- 事件写入同一事务&#10;  INSERT INTO outbox (event_type, payload, status)&#10;  VALUES (&#39;order.completed&#39;, $2, &#39;pending&#39;);&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 业务操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 事件写入同一事务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbox (event_type, payload, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>独立的 outbox poller 进程扫描 <code>status = &#39;pending&#39;</code> 的记录，发布到消息队列后更新状态。这个模式的正确性依赖于数据库事务的 ACID 保证——事件要么与业务操作一起成功，要么一起回滚。</p>\n<p>替代方案包括 CDC（Change Data Capture）——如 Debezium 监听数据库 binlog 直接将变更流式传输到 Kafka——但增加了基础设施复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扇出性能基准\">扇出性能基准</h2><p>参考 Svix 2026 年公开数据，一个成熟的扇出引擎在以下量级运行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>参考值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件吞吐量</td>\n<td>10 万+/秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>p99 投递延迟（队列到 HTTP POST）</td>\n<td>&lt; 500ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单 worker 并发连接</td>\n<td>1000-5000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试队列处理延迟</td>\n<td>&lt; 1s（Tier 1）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些数字需要队列系统（如 Redis Stream、Apache Kafka）、连接池、和 worker 水平扩展的协同支撑。具体的限流策略——如何保护消费者端点不被高频投递压垮——见 <a href=\"rate-limiting-backoff\">限流与退避策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>扇出投递引擎是 webhook 系统的核心执行层。队列优先架构解耦事件产生与投递执行，Transactional Outbox 保证业务事务与事件发布的原子性。多租户场景下，公平队列调度和端点级并发控制防止 noisy neighbor。FIFO 有序投递以吞吐量为代价换取严格顺序——大多数场景不需要，消费者应通过时间戳自行重排。Worker 的连接池管理、超时分级和优雅关闭决定了系统在高并发和重启场景下的稳定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"扇出投递引擎","id":"扇出投递引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心挑战：一事件多订阅者","id":"核心挑战-一事件多订阅者"},{"level":2,"text":"扇出架构模式对比","id":"扇出架构模式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"队列优先架构详解","id":"队列优先架构详解"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户隔离：Noisy Neighbor 问题","id":"多租户隔离-noisy-neighbor-问题"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 公平队列调度（Fair Queuing）","id":"1-公平队列调度-fair-queuing"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 端点级并发控制","id":"2-端点级并发控制"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 动态 Worker 分配","id":"3-动态-worker-分配"},{"level":2,"text":"FIFO 有序投递","id":"fifo-有序投递"},{"level":2,"text":"投递 Worker 的实现要点","id":"投递-worker-的实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"Transactional Outbox 模式","id":"transactional-outbox-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"扇出性能基准","id":"扇出性能基准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件目录与 Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/event-catalog-design"},"next":{"title":"限流与退避策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/rate-limiting-backoff"}}